---
import '../styles/site.css';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="How to join the Masjidee Android pilot, install your invited build and learn about future iPhone availability."/><link rel="icon" href={`${base}/masjidee-mark.svg`}/><title>Get Masjidee — Android pilot</title></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="header"><nav class="nav wrap" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/masjidee-mark.svg`} width="42" height="42" alt=""/>Masjidee</a><a class="text-link" href={`${base}/docs/`}>User guides →</a></nav></header><main id="main" class="article wrap"><a class="back" href={`${base}/`}>← Back to Masjidee</a><p class="eyebrow">SMALL PILOT. SHARED PROGRESS.</p><h1>Let’s take<br/>the next step <em>together.</em></h1><p>Masjidee is currently being tested by a small group on Android. It is not yet listed on Google Play or the Apple App Store.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Already invited?</strong><p>Use the APK and installation instructions sent by your pilot organizer. Download only the build they identify as trusted. There is no public APK download on this website.</p></div><h2>Joining the Android pilot</h2><ol><li>Contact the person who introduced you to Masjidee to ask about testing access.</li><li>Follow their build-specific instructions to install the Android app.</li><li>Sign in, choose your mosque, and check the published prayer schedule.</li><li>Enable reminders or automatic check-ins only if you want them.</li></ol><p><a class="button" href={`${base}/docs/guides/install-android/`}>Read the installation guide →</a></p><h2>What about iPhone?</h2><p>iPhone support is planned. An iOS pilot has not been released or validated yet. We will update this page when testing becomes available; there is no iPhone download or TestFlight invitation to use today.</p><h2>Free to use</h2><p>The current pilot has no app subscription charge. Your normal internet and mobile-data charges may apply.</p><p>Have a question? <a href={`${base}/support/`}>Find help and share feedback.</a></p></main><footer class="footer wrap"><a href={`${base}/`}>Masjidee</a><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href={`${base}/docs/guides/privacy/`}>Privacy & permissions</a><a href={`${base}/support/`}>Support</a></nav></footer></body></html>
